---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <SectionHeading
    eyebrow="Profile"
    title="A structured, reliable approach to software and data"
    lead="My strongest contribution is building applications and reporting systems that teams can use confidently, turning scattered operational data into dependable software and clear insight."
  />

  <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_0.85fr]">
    <article class="reveal rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-paper p-7 shadow-sm">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-ledger">Professional Summary</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">I build the applications and data systems organizations rely on.</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-muted">
        My background spans application development across a range of stacks, database design, SQL optimization,
        data analytics, dashboard development, systems monitoring, data validation, and operational reporting.
        I work best where technical discipline matters and where teams need working software and accurate,
        usable information rather than noise.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="reveal card-hover rounded-3xl border border-hairline bg-paper p-6 shadow-sm">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-ledger">Working style</p>
      <h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Detail-oriented and steady under real operational pressure.</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">
        Comfortable in environments where accuracy, reporting discipline, and stakeholder communication
        all matter at the same time, and open to whatever stack the problem actually calls for.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
